# The Go service images build from the repository root; the analyzer builds
# from services/analyzer with its own .dockerignore.
.git
**/.gitignore
.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Docs
**/*.md

# Tests, coverage and build artifacts
**/tests/
**/testdata/
**/*_test.go
**/coverage.*
**/*.out
**/*.coverprofile
**/*.prof
**/*.test

# IDE and editor files
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.cursor/
**/.claude/
**/*.iml
**/*.sublime*
**/*.swp
**/.DS_Store
